              SCALAR SUBQUERY
                SEARCH events
              SEARCH e USING INTEGER PRIMARY KEY (rowid=?)
          SCALAR SUBQUERY
            SEARCH events
          SEARCH v USING INTEGER PRIMARY KEY (rowid=?) LEFT-JOIN
        MATERIALIZE board
          MATERIALIZE minted
            SCAN m USING COVERING INDEX sqlite_autoindex_mint_1
            SEARCH e USING INTEGER PRIMARY KEY (rowid=?)
            CORRELATED SCALAR SUBQUERY
